971583257751_5658449121001292533_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dHPWUNp7LoAQ7kNvwFFaDCq&_nc_oc=AdoY-JK_fqQiZRSihMbEC1qYVzTVGQy_-sY6953TPGzKxGioS7Bw1tMeh49GL_0M85Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTI8SnskVBR8hopCAnskVai7bB4CztuYd86uZn3679fPQ&oe=6AF32EE5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Greenpill", "keywords": ["training", "presentation", "communication", "simulation", "learning"], "long_description": " Greenpill transforms how professionals prepare for the moments that matter most. Whether you're training for a presentation, a difficult customer conversation, a courtroom hearing or a multi-agency crisis meeting, Greenpill puts you inside the experience.\n\nJoin a live session from your Meta Quest headset by scanning a QR code, no complex setup required. Your facilitator manages the session from a web dashboard, guiding you through immersive environments and real-time scenarios designed to build confidence and sharpen communication skills.\n\n  Key features:\n  - Live facilitator-led VR training sessions\n  - Lifelike characters you can talk to with your own voice\n  - Realistic environments, from a presentation stage and a bakery to a courtroom and a crisis team meeting room\n  - Hand tracking or controllers, your choice\n  - Secure QR pairing, join a session in seconds\n  - Session recording for the debrief with your facilitator\n\nBuilt for teams, trainers and organizations that believe practice in an immersive environment leads to real-world results.", "short_description": "Greenpill is an immersive VR training platform for high-stakes communication. Join live sessions led by a facilitator, talk with lifelike characters in realistic environments, from presentations and customer conversations to crisis meetings, and get feedback."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://greenpill.tech/privacy-policy-greenpill.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service